{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_28_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_28","textTraditional":"一、十有七年，春，正月，丙辰，公會齊侯、紀侯盟於黃。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_28_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_28","textTraditional":"二、二月，丙午，公及邾儀父盟於趡。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_28_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_28","textTraditional":"三、夏，五月，丙午，及齊師戰於郎。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_28_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_28","textTraditional":"內諱敗，舉其可道者也。不言其人，以吾敗也。不言及之者，為內諱也。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_28_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_28","textTraditional":"四、六月，丁丑，蔡侯封人卒。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_28_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_28","textTraditional":"五、秋，八月，蔡季自陳歸於蔡。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_clt_28_7","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_28","textTraditional":"蔡季，蔡之貴者也。自陳，陳有奉焉爾。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_clt_28_8","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_28","textTraditional":"六、癸巳，葬蔡桓侯。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_clt_28_9","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_28","textTraditional":"七、及宋人、衞人伐邾。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_clt_28_10","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_28","textTraditional":"八、冬，十月，朔，日有食之。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_clt_28_11","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_28","textTraditional":"言朔不言日，食既朔也。","sentenceOrder":11}],"overrides":{}}